# Keep the cargo-vendor tree verbatim. The repo-root .gitignore excludes
# directory names that vendored crates legitimately ship as source
# (.claude/, target/, debug/, deps/ — e.g. camino/.claude, cc/src/target,
# syn/tests/debug, wasip{2,3}/wit/deps). Dropping any of them breaks cargo's
# per-file checksum verification (.cargo-checksum.json) on a fresh checkout and
# fails the hermetic eBPF build. Re-include them under the vendor subtree.
!.claude/
!target/
!debug/
!deps/
